  (text "Expansion header (DNP): spare I/O not on the main connector"
    (at 25.4 347.98 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2.54 2.54) bold)
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "a29b4ab1-6894-5615-9be7-55c541f83ad4"))
  (text "MCP23017 at 0x20 (A2..A0 = GND).  GPA7 / GPB7 are OUTPUT-only on current silicon -> status LEDs.\nGPA0-5 = opto inputs (ACTIVE-LOW), GPA6 = EPB button, GPB0-3 = light outputs, GPB4/5 = EPB LEDs,\nGPB6 = PAWL_INH.  INTA -> IOX_INT (configure open-drain, mirrored).\nOpto inputs: 12V -> 2.2k (IN1 P_SENSE 4.7k: light tap on a shared sense line) -> LTV-357T.\nLight outputs: DMN6075S 60V low-side, B5819W flyback to +12V_LOGIC.\nEPB LEDs: high-side 12V (BSS84 50V +-20V Vgs, + 2N7002).  The HAT reads the same lines (EPB_GRN / EPB_RED)."
    (at 20 15 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "4a1cb532-8d5c-5676-b8e8-00af1e6a9e68")))
